
>> a := Lethathamo ← (Lethathamo ← 100 ; 200 ; 300) ; (Lethathamo ← 9 ; 8 ; 7).
Sephetho ngola: ['at 0,1 :'].
Sephetho ngola: a ? 0 ? 1, mola-o-mocha. 
Sephetho ngola: ['at 1,2 :'].
Sephetho ngola: a ? 1 ? 2, mola-o-mocha. 
>> menu := Bukantswe ncha.
menu beha: (Lethathamo ← ['pizza'] ; ['spaghetti']) sebakeng: ['Italian Cuisine'].
menu beha: (Lethathamo ← ['bifteki'] ; ['suflaki']) sebakeng: ['Greek Cuisine'].
Sephetho ngola: ['I love '] + (menu ? ['Greek Cuisine'] ? 0) + [' and '] + (menu ? ['Italian Cuisine'] ? 1), mola-o-mocha. 
Sephetho ngola: ['but not on the same plate.'], mola-o-mocha.
